RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 63% of normal in September to October and 55% in October to November. June to July is the wettest pair at 11.12 inches normal, and in 2026 it came in at 139% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
